// A `for` binds a component its entities may be without, `optional t:
// Label`, and visits those without it too: `if let` says which. The
// component may be missing from the archetype, or held optionally in it.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/optional_own.ent 2>/dev/null | sort | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %ent run --parallel %S/Inputs/optional_own.ent 2>/dev/null | sort | FileCheck %s

